---
title: Cluster Listing (Tenant Scoped)
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Admin SPA
    participant API as /recognition/clusters
    participant Session as AsyncSession
    participant DB as identity_clusters + centroids
    participant ClusterSvc as IdentityClusteringService

    Client->>API: GET clusters?tenant_id=&limit=&offset=
    API->>Session: set_tenant_context()
    API->>DB: select clusters ORDER BY created_at DESC LIMIT/OFFSET
    loop per cluster
        API->>ClusterSvc: get_cluster_summary(cluster_id)
        ClusterSvc->>DB: load members + representative + centroid
        ClusterSvc-->>API: summary (label, members, rep, centroid)
    end
    API-->>Client: list[ClusterSummaryResponse]
